Description:
    ShinyPopGen is an interactive Shiny application for population genetics
    analyses based on multilocus individual genotype datasets. It provides
    tools for data preparation, genetic diversity assessment, F-statistics
    estimation, ENA correction for null alleles, linkage disequilibrium
    analysis, population differentiation, and graphical exploration.
    The application also supports simulation-based approaches for evaluating
    population genetic parameters under theoretical models.

